Typing Speed Studio — Business Edition
A premium, single-file typing platform that generates real business writing — memos, emails, negotiation lines, and reports — as practice text, then grades every session with a Monkeytype-style analytics report.
Built for Day 38 of #60DaysOfClaudeAI.
�
Why this exists
Generic typing tests train you on random text. This one trains you on the kind of writing you actually type at work, so the practice transfers directly to your inbox and your reports — not just your typing score.
Features
Typing modes
Time — 15 / 30 / 60 / 120 second sprints
Word Count — 25 / 50 / 100 / 250 word passages
Quote — short business and leadership aphorisms
Custom Text — paste your own passage to practice
Adaptive — difficulty (easy / medium / hard vocabulary) auto-tunes based on your accuracy and speed after each run
Zen — untimed, distraction-free practice
Focus Mode — an optional overlay that only reveals the current line
Live stats
WPM, Raw WPM, Accuracy, CPM, elapsed/remaining time, mistake count, current streak, and a live progress bar — all updating on every keystroke, with correct/incorrect/current character highlighting.
Post-session analytics dashboard
Net WPM, Raw WPM, Accuracy, Consistency, Completion %
Characters typed: correct / incorrect / extra / missed
WPM + accuracy graph (canvas-drawn, no chart library)
Error heatmap of most mistyped keys
Percentile estimate against a general typist baseline
Achievement badges (Speed Demon, Precision Master, Steady Hand, Marathon Draft, and more)
Personal bests per mode
Auto-generated summary of strengths, weaknesses, and next-step suggestions
Personalization
Dark and parchment surface themes, with 4 selectable accent palettes
Adjustable font size
Optional keystroke and completion sound (Web Audio, no audio files)
Keyboard shortcuts: Tab to restart, Esc to pause/resume
Fully responsive and accessible (visible focus states, reduced-motion support)
Data & privacy
All session history, streaks, and personal bests are stored in the browser's localStorage. No account, no backend, no external requests except Google Fonts.
Tech stack
Vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Zero frameworks, zero build step, zero dependencies.
Run it
Download typing-speed-studio.html and open it directly in any modern browser. That's it.
